Third-party libraries
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

No third-party library source code is included in this repository. Binaries
built from it link third-party libraries obtained in two different ways:

  1. Zstandard and LZ4: static libraries compiled by CMake (FetchContent in
     sw-pack/CMakeLists.txt) from the lib/ directory of source tarballs that
     CMake downloads at build time and checks with URL_HASH (SHA-256). Nothing
     from programs/ or contrib/ of either project is built.
  2. libsodium: built by vcpkg (vcpkg.json, dependency "libsodium", pinned by
     builtin-baseline). The vcpkg port fetches the GitHub archive of git tag
     1.0.22-RELEASE (vcpkg_from_github, checked by SHA-512 in the port; that is
     the repository tag, not the distribution tarball) and applies its own
     patches. Some CI jobs use the operating-system package instead.

